{"t":"Their Master's Voice World Change","s":"their-master-s-voice-world-change-592d4","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Servant_Sentry_356d51.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Their Master's Voice World Change</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Edron Mad Mage Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8+<br/>(80+ recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Changes\">World Change</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9.10<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 6, 2011<br/>Summer Update 2011</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>A mad mage built a tower in Edron to conduct experiments.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edrons</a> - <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Mad Mage Dungeon</strong>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33313,31839,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33313, 31839, 7)</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Snake\">Snakes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Iron%20Servant\">Iron Servants</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Golden%20Servant\">Golden Servants</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Diamond%20Servant\">Diamond Servants</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Mad%20Mage\">Mad Mage</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>Potential to loot items for <a href=\"#/wiki/Elementalist%20Outfits\">Elementalist Outfit</a>, and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Golden%20Can%20of%20Oil\">Golden Can of Oil</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Fungus_Cleaning\">Fungus Cleaning</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Servant%20Sentry\"><img alt=\"Servant Sentry\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Servant_Sentry_356d51.gif\" width=\"99\"/></a></span></span>\n</p><p>Travel to <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> and head south of <a href=\"#/wiki/Stonehome\">Stonehome</a>. You’ll find a ruined tower <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33314,31837,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33314, 31837, 7)</a>. Cross the bridge and talk to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Servant%20Sentry\">Servant Sentry</a>. \n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: hi<br/>\nServant Sentry: The. <b>Slime</b>. Has. Entered. Our. <b>Master</b>. Has. Left! We. Must. <b>Help</b>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: help<br/>\nServant Sentry: Defeat. <b>Slime</b>. We. Will. Why. Did. You. Kill. Us? Do. You. Want. To. Rectify. And. Help?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: yes<br/>\nServant Sentry: Then. Take. This. Gobbler. Always. Hungry. Eats. Slime. Fungus. Go.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Their Master's Voice World Change</strong></span>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 350px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"Slime Gobbler being used to remove fungus\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"258\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/TMV1_865baa.png\" width=\"350\"/> <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\">Slime Gobbler being used to remove fungus</p> </figcaption> </figure><br/>\n<p>You will receive a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Slime%20Gobbler\"><img alt=\"Slime Gobbler\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Slime_Gobbler_71dd5b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Slime%20Gobbler\">Slime Gobbler</a>. Go down two floors to reach the main area <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33312,31853,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33312, 31853, 9)</a>. Depending on your <a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Changes\">world status</a>, there will be <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Slime%20Fungus\"><img alt=\"Slime Fungus\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Slime_Fungus_7e8e82.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Slime%20Fungus\">Slime Fungus</a> scattered throughout the dungeon all over.\n</p><p>Use the Slime Gobbler on the Slime Fungus. When done correctly, the tile will be cleaned and you’ll receive 20 experience points.\n</p><p><b>Note: You can only remove one fungus every 5 seconds.</b> There are <b>350 fungus tiles</b> in total, so it’s highly recommended to bring friends to speed up the process.\n</p><p>After the 10.52 Update, each player must \"gobble\" at least <b>25 fungus tiles</b> to be eligible to face the <a href=\"#/wiki/Mad%20Mage\">Mad Mage</a>. Once you reach the threshold, you'll see this message:<br/>\n<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You gobbled enough slime to get a good grip on this dungeon's slippery floor.</span>\n</p><p>If you're solo and clear the entire dungeon, you won’t be able to leave — otherwise, the fungus will regenerate and the Servants will stop spawning. You can re-enter the dungeon if someone else is still inside. In this case, the next wave will resume from where it left off.\n</p><p>If you were part of a team and didn’t kill the Mad Mage but another player did while you were present, you’ll get the message:<br/>\n<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">The mage has escaped, better start gobbling to face him again!</span>\n</p><p>You’ll need to clean the fungus again in order to trigger a new Mad Mage spawn.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Servant_Raids\">Servant Raids</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 350px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"Iron Servants spawning south of the entrance\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"258\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/TMV3_33e0b4.png\" width=\"350\"/>  <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\">Iron Servants spawning south of the entrance</p> </figcaption> </figure><br/>\n<p>Once the dungeon is fully cleaned, waves of Mage Servants will begin to spawn. These appear in groups of <a href=\"#/wiki/Iron%20Servant\">Iron</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Golden%20Servant\">Golden</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Diamond%20Servant\">Diamond Servants</a>.\n</p><p>A typical solo session contains approximately:\n</p>\n<ul><li>250 <a href=\"#/wiki/Iron%20Servant\">Iron Servants</a></li>\n<li>200 <a href=\"#/wiki/Golden%20Servant\">Golden Servants</a></li>\n<li>60   <a href=\"#/wiki/Diamond%20Servant\">Diamond Servants</a></li></ul>\n<p>A new wave will begin <b>immediately</b> after all Servants from the previous wave were killed.  \n<b>Important: All Servants must be killed for the next wave to spawn.</b>\n</p><p>After clearing all waves, the <a href=\"#/wiki/Mad%20Mage\">Mad Mage</a> will appear in one of three random locations:<br/>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left\" style=\"width: 64px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <a href=\"#/wiki/Mad%20Mage\"><img alt=\"Mad Mage\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mad_Mage_74c470.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a>  <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> </figcaption> </figure>\n<ul><li>The northern corridor <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33355,31855,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33355, 31855, 9)</a></li>\n<li>The far eastern corridor <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33368,31874,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33368, 31874, 9)</a></li>\n<li>The south eastern corridor <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33349,31902,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33349, 31902, 9)</a></li></ul>\n<p><br/>\nOnce the <a href=\"#/wiki/Mad%20Mage\">Mad Mage</a> is slain, the fungus will return to the dungeon — awaiting the next player willing to help the Servants again.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["elementalist-outfits-quest"]}